# Climatic Mysteries — unpack close-ups (locked)

## Approach

Click item name → **swap backdrop** to a **close-up PNG** cropped from `rental_unpack_scene.png`.

**Same pixels only** — one rug, one table, one room. Regenerate with the build script; do not use separate AI close-up art.

**Do not** bring back CSS pan/zoom camera math on the wide room image.

## Code touch points

- `UNPACK_OBJECTS[].closeup` — image key per item
- `focusUnpackItem` — `setPrologueBackdrop(obj.closeup)`
- `resetUnpackFocus` — restore `RENTAL_UNPACK_SCENE`
- `preloadUnpackCloseups` on rental enter

## Allowed edits

- Tune pad factors in `build-unpack-closeups.py` per item
- Adjust fade CSS on `#prologue-bus-frame.rental-unpack.item-focused`

**Not allowed** without owner asking: new AI close-up art, `buildItemCameraFocus`, bbox auto-zoom on wide scene.

## Deploy

`bash climaticMysteries/scripts/deploy.sh`
